POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Login user simple (enregistre le token dans la variable userToken)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "1111"
}

> {% client.global.set("userToken", response.body.token); %}

### 3. Profil avec le token admin -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Profil avec le token user -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 5. Dashboard admin avec le token admin -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Dashboard admin avec le token user -> 403 (rôle insuffisant)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 7. Sans token -> 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile

### 8. Token invalide -> 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer abc.def.ghi

### 9. Mauvais mot de passe -> 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "mauvais"
}
